  + [requirement] is improve quote and sticky controls while preserving anchor validation and provenance
  + [fork_commit] is d6aaf556
  + [solution] is active cuts now show persisted quotes, quote capture forms, pinned reminder chips, and unpin controls
  + [solution] is chapters now show bookmarks, quotes, pinned reminder chips, unpin controls, bookmark forms, and quote capture forms
  + [solution] is existing API validation remains responsible for rejecting missing cut or chapter anchors
  + [solution] is runtime proof markers now assert quote and sticky UI strings/classes
  + [data_design_reason] is quote and sticky controls operate on explicit cut/chapter target identity rather than visual-only selection state
  + [ui_interaction_reason] is quote capture and sticky clearing are visible user actions instead of hidden helper functions

  = must: preserve quote provenance and sticky target identity through the refinement API
  = must: clear stickies through durable clear_state instead of deleting target evidence
  = should: keep future polish focused on selection ergonomics and citation rendering rather than schema churn

